Shared Web has consumed the Application-defined portfolio/positions/order-trade/performance projection semantics for current planning.

Planning compatibility result: VERIFIED.

The current Web UX direction remains compatible with the Application response:
- regular-user UX presents current/live user portfolio/trading experience only;
- simulator presentation remains Owner-only;
- raw BrokerId/BrokerAccountId routing is not a normal user-facing navigation concept;
- Web may present Portfolio Summary, Positions, Activity and Performance only from the bounded authoritative Trading projections;
